1 0 obj<</Author(StarryNap)/CreationDate(D:20261101013858+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Mature, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Alternate Universe - Canon Divergence, Arranged Marriage, Secret Identity, Adora is in Love with Catra \(She-Ra\), Catra is in Love with Adora \(She-Ra\), F/F, Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings, Catra thinks Adora is dead, Past established Relationship, Catra thinks She-Ra killed Adora, Nobody knows Adora is She-Ra besides Bow and Glimmer, Catra is very angry, Angst, The whole series has a happy ending, But this work is just angst for now, sorry - Freeform, Adora loves Catra so very much, Love Confessions, Hate to Love, Not Actually Unrequited Love, heavy make outs, No spicy times on this one, Poor Catra give her a breath, Also poor Adora someone hug her please, Adora is so much better at She-Ra here, She-Ra and Adora are the same person btw, No magical spirit living inside Adora or nothing like that, Just a depressed girl with magic powers on steroids, Catra Needs Therapy \(She-Ra\), They both do, Marriage of Convenience, Kisses as an apology, Other Additional Tags to Be Added)/ModDate(D:20261101013858+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(Lover)>>
